== Installer moonshot

#badge-roadmap[
  Native installers and one click bliss for relatives who do not enjoy terminals.
  The engineering notes already describe validated bundles and smoke paths.
  The user experience still wants the last mile where no one has to think about Python.
]

== Collaboration without turning into a surveillance shop

#badge-roadmap[
